ForwardERC20_MayanAdapter_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when amountIn zero
│  └── it should revert with InvalidAmount
└── when amountIn non zero
   ├── when protocolData selector not createOrderWithToken
   │  └── it should revert with UnsupportedProtocolData
   ├── when order token or amount mismatch
   │  └── it should revert with ProtocolDataMismatch
   ├── when trader not vault
   │  └── it should revert with TraderNotVault
   ├── when route not allowed
   │  └── it should revert with RouteNotAllowed
   └── when order valid and route allowed
      ├── it should pull amountIn from the vault
      ├── it should forward to the swift protocol with protocolData
      ├── it should reset forwarder allowance to zero
      ├── it should emit AdapterAction
      └── it should return amountIn
